OL,3,GNEWSACampaigning parents call for
OL,4,Abetter paternity leave
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and campaigners have gathered
OL,7,Fin Oxford to call for six weeks of
OL,8,Fparental leave at 90% pay for both
OL,9,Fmothers and fathers.
OL,11,FThe demonstration in Bonn Square was
OL,12,Fone of a number of Parent Strike events
OL,13,Fheld in cities across the UK.
OL,15,FOrganisers said better paternity leave
OL,16,Fwas "a simple ask" so that both parents
OL,17,Fcould look after their children
OL,18,Fequally.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
