OL,3,GNEWSACampaigning parents call for
OL,4,Abetter paternity leave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was reviewing
OL,7,Fparental pay and leave to "ensure we
OL,8,Freflect the realities of modern work
OL,9,Fand childcare". The review is expected
OL,10,Fto be completed by the end of the year.
